tr.td:
Whichever of the following applies:
(a) if the member or Senator is a member of a registered political party—the registered officer of the registered political party;
(b) otherwise—the member or Senator

Whichever of the following applies:
(a) if the candidate is endorsed by a registered political party—the registered officer of the registered political party;
(b) otherwise—the agent of the candidate

Whichever of the following applies:
(a) the registered officer of the State branch;
(b) if the State branch is not a registered political party—the agent of the State branch

Whichever of the following applies:
(a) if the State branch is a registered political party—the registered officer of the State branch;
(b) otherwise—the agent of the State branch

Whichever of the following applies:
(a) if the member is a member of a registered political party—the registered officer of the registered political party;
(b) otherwise—the member

Whichever of the following applies:
(a) if the Senator is a member of a registered political party—the registered officer of the registered political party;
(b) otherwise—the Senator

Whichever of the following applies:
(a) if the candidate is endorsed by a registered political party—the registered officer of the registered political party;
(b) otherwise—the agent of the candidate
